# Data Ingestion Standards (Python Workers)

## Architecture
* These workers run completely independent of the FastAPI backend.
* Enforce strict idempotency: multiple runs over the same raw data must result in the same database state without duplicating scores.

## Resilience & Dirty Data
* Implement exponential backoff and retry logic for network requests or FTP polling.
* Use Pydantic to aggressively type-cast and validate scraped HTML/regex data before attempting database inserts.
* Log all anomalous data structures without crashing the worker process.
